            <ArticleTitle>[Effect of omega-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids on clinical efficacy and the state of cytokines in patients with bronchial asthma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>64-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>IL-1beta, IL-4, IL-8, IL-10, TNF-alpha content are studied in patients with severe bronchial asthma on the background of basis therapy and complex therapy including omega-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids. Complex therapy appeared to be more effective, considerable decrease in IL-1beta, normalization of IL-4, IL-8, TNF-alpha and increase in IL-10 were detected.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
